  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "Everyone blames the housing shortage for sky-high prices. The shortage is real, but it is nowhere near the whole story.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "hook",
          "art": "home",
          "props": [
            "house",
            "house",
            "x"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "Not just",
            "a shortage."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s1"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Yes, America is short roughly three point eight million homes, and that absolutely pushes prices up.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "home",
          "big": "3.8M",
          "label": "homes short",
          "props": [
            "house",
            "house"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s2"
    },
    {
      "narration": "But here is the hidden reason almost nobody talks about. Millions of existing owners are locked in place.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "truth",
          "art": "lock",
          "kicker": "the hidden reason",
          "line": "Mortgage lock-in",
          "sub": "3% owners won't sell into 7%"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "narration": "Look what happened to mortgage rates, roughly tripling in just a couple of years.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "fred-rate",
          "kicker": "FRED · 30-year mortgage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Owners holding a three percent mortgage simply will not sell and take on a new loan at seven percent.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "3% vs 7%",
          "props": [
            "lock",
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s5"
    },
    {
      "narration": "That froze an estimated one point seven million home sales, supply that just never reached the market.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "lock",
          "big": "1.7M",
          "label": "sales that never happened",
          "props": [
            "lock",
            "x"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "narration": "You can see it directly in the inventory, which stayed starved for years.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "fred-inv",
          "kicker": "FRED · housing inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "narration": "And the squeeze lands on renters, nearly half of whom are now cost burdened.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-crisis",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · US housing crisis"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "So would you give up a three percent rate to move? Almost nobody will, and that is the real freeze.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "question",
          "art": "lock",
          "line": "Would you give up 3%?",
          "sub": "That's the real freeze"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s9"
    }
